  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of the rusted-out Subchain City skyline, 'Chill' Quackers grew up scavenging for scraps and avoiding the territorial spats between rival duck flocks. The sight of too many fellow ducks ending up as roadkill beneath the treads of raiding parties hardened his shell and gave him a perpetually world-weary outlook.",
    "class": "Road Warrior",
    "name": "'Chill' Quackers",
    "personality": "Sarcastic, Pragmatic, and Loyal. Chill has a biting sense of humor and a seen-it-all attitude. Despite his cynicism, he fiercely protects those he considers part of his 'flock,' putting himself in harm's way without hesitation. He appreciates the warmth from his Warmy Shirt Shadow as he is more comfortable in colder weather",
